= Hello from node two
This document arrived in a custom binary YNP frame.
:: Experimental network
  This legacy ynp:// demo is restricted to numeric loopback addresses.
  The demo is plaintext. Remote yami:// and ynps:// sites require pinned TLS.
  > ynp://127.0.0.1:7301/welcome | Return to the first node
